<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>회원가입 - 가계부</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/main.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="bg-light">

    <div class="container register-wrapper">
        
        <!-- 1. 상단 브랜딩 로고 -->
        <div class="text-center mb-4 pb-2">
            <a href="/" class="text-decoration-none d-inline-flex align-items-center fs-3 text-dark fw-bold">
                <span class="me-2 opacity-75">👛</span>가계부
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. 회원가입 카드 영역 -->
        <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 rounded-3">
            <div class="card-body p-4 p-sm-5">
                <h3 class="card-title fs-4 fw-bold mb-4 text-dark text-center">회원가입</h3>
                
                <form method="post" action="/register/request">
                    

                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="id" class="form-label small fw-semibold text-secondary mb-1">아이디</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-lg fs-6 py-2.5" id="id" name="username" placeholder="아이디 입력" required autocomplete="username">
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="password" class="form-label small fw-semibold text-secondary mb-1">비밀번호</label>
                        <input type="password" class="form-control form-control-lg fs-6 py-2.5" id="password" name="password" placeholder="비밀번호 입력" required autocomplete="new-password">
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="mb-4 pb-1">
                        <label for="re-password" class="form-label small fw-semibold text-secondary mb-1">비밀번호 재입력</label>
                        <input type="password" class="form-control form-control-lg fs-6 py-2.5" id="re-password" name="rePassword" placeholder="비밀번호 확인" required autocomplete="new-password">
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="d-grid">
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-dark-custom btn-lg fs-6 fw-semibold py-2.5 rounded-2">회원가입 완료</button>
                    </div>
                </form>

                <div class="text-center mt-4 pt-3 border-top">
                    <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                        이미 회원이신가요? 
                        <a href="/login" class="text-dark fw-bold text-decoration-none ms-1 link-hover">로그인하기</a>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <style>
        /* 💡 로그인 화면과 균형을 맞춘 반응형 스타일 */
        .register-wrapper {
            max-width: 460px;
            padding-top: 80px;
            padding-bottom: 60px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            .register-wrapper {
                max-width: 100%;
                padding-top: 40px;
            }
        }

        /* 다크 톤 버튼 및 인풋 포커스 스타일 */
        .btn-dark-custom {
            background-color: #212529;
            color: #ffffff;
            border: none;
            transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
        }
        .btn-dark-custom:hover {
            background-color: #343a40;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: #212529;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.25rem rgba(33, 37, 41, 0.1);
        }
        .link-hover:hover {
            text-decoration: underline !important;
        }
    </style>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>